Strategy lines and domain lists in this directory are taken from
ByeByeDPI by romanvht (https://github.com/romanvht/ByeByeDPI),
files app/src/main/assets/proxytest_strategies.list and proxytest_*.sites.

ByeByeDPI is licensed under the GNU GPL version 3.
The Forkop checker is a separate implementation of the same idea:
start local ciadpi as a SOCKS proxy, request each site through it,
and treat a strategy as better when more response bodies arrive in full.
